WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.001
I learn English.

2
00:00:09.001 --> 00:00:14.774
I'm only a beginner.

3
00:00:16.774 --> 00:00:24.976
I still make many mistakes.

4
00:00:26.976 --> 00:00:34.787
I don't understand the word.

5
00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:44.467
I don't understand the meaning.

6
00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:51.848
I've forgotten it.

7
00:00:53.848 --> 00:01:11.376
I don't remember the name right now.

8
00:01:15.376 --> 00:01:21.436
Learning foreign languages

9
00:01:23.436 --> 00:01:33.807
Learning languages is interesting.

10
00:01:35.807 --> 00:01:50.096
Yes, and I also speak some Italian.

11
00:01:52.096 --> 00:02:02.754
The languages are quite similar.

12
00:02:04.754 --> 00:02:11.076
I can understand them well.

13
00:02:15.076 --> 00:02:23.566
We are learning a language.

14
00:02:25.566 --> 00:02:38.915
We want to understand people.

15
00:02:40.915 --> 00:02:57.268
We want to speak with people.

16
00:02:59.268 --> 00:03:07.888
He studies languages.

17
00:03:09.888 --> 00:03:18.090
He speaks several languages.

18
00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:31.128
You learn Spanish.

19
00:03:33.128 --> 00:03:42.010
I think you speak very well.

20
00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:50.593
Where do you come from?

21
00:03:52.593 --> 00:04:02.023
Are you taking a language course?

22
00:04:04.023 --> 00:04:10.763
Your pronunciation is very good.
